// Zara the Mummy - talkable, non-hostile merchant in QCTENT01.
// Her CRE is based on the existing Fergie CRE so she keeps the same equipment;
// only the animation is replaced with the standard generic mummy animation.
ACTION_IF NOT FILE_EXISTS_IN_GAME ~MUMMY01.CRE~ BEGIN
  FAIL @20012
END

